{"seq": 4, "event": "status_update", "data": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "result": {"taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce", "kind": "status-update", "status": {"state": "working", "message": {"kind": "message", "messageId": "01a1ac8dbc8b7825b1ce188fbdc8021b", "role": "agent", "parts": [{"data": {"type": "artifact_creation_progress", "filename": "pallet-damage.md", "status": "in-progress", "bytes_transferred": 156, "description": "One-page memo on pallet damage handling.", "artifact_chunk": "**To:** Warehouse, Receiving and Accounts Payable Teams\n**From:** Operations\n**Date:** «datetime:%Y-%m-%d»\n**Subject:** Handling Damaged Pallets\n\n", "mime_type": "text/markdown", "version": null, "function_call_id": null}, "kind": "data"}], "taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce"}, "timestamp": "2026-11-05T16:32:12.427536+00:00"}, "final": false, "metadata": {"agent_name": "agent_01a1a866_2d7e_732c_8d39_e58a10533926"}}}}
{"seq": 5, "event": "status_update", "data": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "result": {"taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce", "kind": "status-update", "status": {"state": "working", "message": {"kind": "message", "messageId": "01a1ac8dbdb777e7857c3ccd0819f6ba", "role": "agent", "parts": [{"data": {"type": "artifact_creation_progress", "filename": "pallet-damage.md", "status": "in-progress", "bytes_transferred": 173, "description": "One-page memo on pallet damage handling.", "artifact_chunk": "---\n\n## Purpose\n\n", "mime_type": "text/markdown", "version": null, "function_call_id": null}, "kind": "data"}], "taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce"}, "timestamp": "2026-11-05T16:32:12.727521+00:00"}, "final": false, "metadata": {"agent_name": "agent_01a1a866_2d7e_732c_8d39_e58a10533926"}}}}
{"seq": 6, "event": "status_update", "data": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "result": {"taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce", "kind": "status-update", "status": {"state": "working", "message": {"kind": "message", "messageId": "01a1ac8dc00f7981b614575fd519a0a4", "role": "agent", "parts": [{"data": {"type": "artifact_creation_progress", "filename": "pallet-damage.md", "status": "in-progress", "bytes_transferred": 393, "description": "One-page memo on pallet damage handling.", "artifact_chunk": "This memo sets out a consistent process for handling damaged pallets, from receiving through to resolution. Following it protects our staff, preserves stock quality and supports any claim against a carrier or supplier.\n\n", "mime_type": "text/markdown", "version": null, "function_call_id": null}, "kind": "data"}], "taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce"}, "timestamp": "2026-11-05T16:32:13.327630+00:00"}, "final": false, "metadata": {"agent_name": "agent_01a1a866_2d7e_732c_8d39_e58a10533926"}}}}
{"seq": 7, "event": "status_update", "data": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "result": {"taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce", "kind": "status-update", "status": {"state": "working", "message": {"kind": "message", "messageId": "01a1ac8dc1417d0fbaa1d09c247d452d", "role": "agent", "parts": [{"data": {"type": "artifact_creation_progress", "filename": "pallet-damage.md", "status": "in-progress", "bytes_transferred": 438, "description": "One-page memo on pallet damage handling.", "artifact_chunk": "## 1. At Receiving: Inspect Before You Sign\n\n", "mime_type": "text/markdown", "version": null, "function_call_id": null}, "kind": "data"}], "taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce"}, "timestamp": "2026-11-05T16:32:13.633862+00:00"}, "final": false, "metadata": {"agent_name": "agent_01a1a866_2d7e_732c_8d39_e58a10533926"}}}}
{"seq": 8, "event": "status_update", "data": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "result": {"taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce", "kind": "status-update", "status": {"state": "working", "message": {"kind": "message", "messageId": "01a1ac8dc393798585d175bdbb0c6a0d", "role": "agent", "parts": [{"data": {"type": "artifact_creation_progress", "filename": "pallet-damage.md", "status": "in-progress", "bytes_transferred": 586, "description": "One-page memo on pallet damage handling.", "artifact_chunk": "- Check each pallet for crushed or torn cartons, broken or missing boards, leaning loads, wet or stained packaging, and torn or loose stretch wrap.\n", "mime_type": "text/markdown", "version": null, "function_call_id": null}, "kind": "data"}], "taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce"}, "timestamp": "2026-11-05T16:32:14.227632+00:00"}, "final": false, "metadata": {"agent_name": "agent_01a1a866_2d7e_732c_8d39_e58a10533926"}}}}
{"seq": 9, "event": "status_update", "data": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "result": {"taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce", "kind": "status-update", "status": {"state": "working", "message": {"kind": "message", "messageId": "01a1ac8dc4bf7956b37a30a4cc2c5f66", "role": "agent", "parts": [{"data": {"type": "artifact_creation_progress", "filename": "pallet-damage.md", "status": "in-progress", "bytes_transferred": 779, "description": "One-page memo on pallet damage handling.", "artifact_chunk": "- **Note damage on the delivery receipt or proof of delivery before signing.** Use specific wording, such as \"2 cartons crushed, pallet 3 of 8\". Avoid vague notes like \"subject to inspection\".\n", "mime_type": "text/markdown", "version": null, "function_call_id": null}, "kind": "data"}], "taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce"}, "timestamp": "2026-11-05T16:32:14.527618+00:00"}, "final": false, "metadata": {"agent_name": "agent_01a1a866_2d7e_732c_8d39_e58a10533926"}}}}
{"seq": 10, "event": "status_update", "data": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "result": {"taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce", "kind": "status-update", "status": {"state": "working", "message": {"kind": "message", "messageId": "01a1ac8dc717787b8483913018038fe2", "role": "agent", "parts": [{"data": {"type": "artifact_creation_progress", "filename": "pallet-damage.md", "status": "in-progress", "bytes_transferred": 1014, "description": "One-page memo on pallet damage handling.", "artifact_chunk": "- If damage is severe, or the load looks unsafe, refuse the delivery or the affected pallets.\n\n## 2. Document the Damage\n\n- Take clear photos of the following:\n  - the overall pallet, from all four sides\n  - the damaged area, close up\n", "mime_type": "text/markdown", "version": null, "function_call_id": null}, "kind": "data"}], "taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce"}, "timestamp": "2026-11-05T16:32:15.127560+00:00"}, "final": false, "metadata": {"agent_name": "agent_01a1a866_2d7e_732c_8d39_e58a10533926"}}}}
{"seq": 11, "event": "status_update", "data": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "result": {"taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce", "kind": "status-update", "status": {"state": "working", "message": {"kind": "message", "messageId": "01a1ac8dc843785881c1ba70c3fd88a0", "role": "agent", "parts": [{"data": {"type": "artifact_creation_progress", "filename": "pallet-damage.md", "status": "in-progress", "bytes_transferred": 1064, "description": "One-page memo on pallet damage handling.", "artifact_chunk": "  - the shipping labels\n  - the trailer condition\n", "mime_type": "text/markdown", "version": null, "function_call_id": null}, "kind": "data"}], "taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce"}, "timestamp": "2026-11-05T16:32:15.427557+00:00"}, "final": false, "metadata": {"agent_name": "agent_01a1a866_2d7e_732c_8d39_e58a10533926"}}}}
{"seq": 12, "event": "status_update", "data": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "result": {"taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce", "kind": "status-update", "status": {"state": "working", "message": {"kind": "message", "messageId": "01a1ac8dc96f78aeb683b8ed694b94f3", "role": "agent", "parts": [{"data": {"type": "artifact_creation_progress", "filename": "pallet-damage.md", "status": "in-progress", "bytes_transferred": 1160, "description": "One-page memo on pallet damage handling.", "artifact_chunk": "- Record the PO number, SKU, quantity affected, carrier, delivery date and the receiver's name.\n", "mime_type": "text/markdown", "version": null, "function_call_id": null}, "kind": "data"}], "taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce"}, "timestamp": "2026-11-05T16:32:15.727574+00:00"}, "final": false, "metadata": {"agent_name": "agent_01a1a866_2d7e_732c_8d39_e58a10533926"}}}}
{"seq": 13, "event": "status_update", "data": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "result": {"taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce", "kind": "status-update", "status": {"state": "working", "message": {"kind": "message", "messageId": "01a1ac8dcbc77822b94b61369e7c58c8", "role": "agent", "parts": [{"data": {"type": "artifact_creation_progress", "filename": "pallet-damage.md", "status": "in-progress", "bytes_transferred": 1414, "description": "One-page memo on pallet damage handling.", "artifact_chunk": "- Keep all documents together in one claim file.\n\n## 3. Segregate and Protect\n\n- Move damaged pallets to the designated quarantine area and tag them **\"Damaged – Hold\"**.\n- Do not put damaged stock into available inventory until it has been inspected.\n", "mime_type": "text/markdown", "version": null, "function_call_id": null}, "kind": "data"}], "taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce"}, "timestamp": "2026-11-05T16:32:16.327535+00:00"}, "final": false, "metadata": {"agent_name": "agent_01a1a866_2d7e_732c_8d39_e58a10533926"}}}}
{"seq": 14, "event": "status_update", "data": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "result": {"taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce", "kind": "status-update", "status": {"state": "working", "message": {"kind": "message", "messageId": "01a1ac8dccf378c693f13c8f953f8aa8", "role": "agent", "parts": [{"data": {"type": "artifact_creation_progress", "filename": "pallet-damage.md", "status": "in-progress", "bytes_transferred": 1535, "description": "One-page memo on pallet damage handling.", "artifact_chunk": "- Only trained staff should restack, repack or re-palletise. Never lift a pallet that is unstable or has broken boards.\n\n", "mime_type": "text/markdown", "version": null, "function_call_id": null}, "kind": "data"}], "taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce"}, "timestamp": "2026-11-05T16:32:16.627584+00:00"}, "final": false, "metadata": {"agent_name": "agent_01a1a866_2d7e_732c_8d39_e58a10533926"}}}}
{"seq": 15, "event": "status_update", "data": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "result": {"taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce", "kind": "status-update", "status": {"state": "working", "message": {"kind": "message", "messageId": "01a1ac8dce1f787ba7d13e3ff86f4c50", "role": "agent", "parts": [{"data": {"type": "artifact_creation_progress", "filename": "pallet-damage.md", "status": "in-progress", "bytes_transferred": 1593, "description": "One-page memo on pallet damage handling.", "artifact_chunk": "## 4. Assess and Decide\n\n| Condition | Action |\n|---|---|\n", "mime_type": "text/markdown", "version": null, "function_call_id": null}, "kind": "data"}], "taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce"}, "timestamp": "2026-11-05T16:32:16.927558+00:00"}, "final": false, "metadata": {"agent_name": "agent_01a1a866_2d7e_732c_8d39_e58a10533926"}}}}
{"seq": 16, "event": "status_update", "data": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "result": {"taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce", "kind": "status-update", "status": {"state": "working", "message": {"kind": "message", "messageId": "01a1ac8dcf4b7144a16e919061def8fd", "role": "agent", "parts": [{"data": {"type": "artifact_creation_progress", "filename": "pallet-damage.md", "status": "in-progress", "bytes_transferred": 1731, "description": "One-page memo on pallet damage handling.", "artifact_chunk": "| Packaging only, product intact | Repack and release to stock |\n| Partial product damage | Separate good units and quarantine the rest |\n", "mime_type": "text/markdown", "version": null, "function_call_id": null}, "kind": "data"}], "taskId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-7add-9e8e-c4cf32723c8a", "contextId": "01a1ac8d-b20d-76c2-8a58-b73df31ba4ce"}, "timestamp": "2026-11-05T16:32:17.227087+00:00"}, "final": false, "metadata": {"agent_name": "agent_01a1a866_2d7e_732c_8d39_e58a10533926"}}}}
